A box given upon opening a Dredgion Daily Supplies Box. Open to randomly receive 1 - 2 Standard Weapon Augmentation Modules (1 of Damage/Speed/Expansion/Concentration/Trait) or 1 -2 Premium Weapon Augmentation Modules (1 of Damage/Speed/Expansion/Concentration/Trait).

{color:#edec72}Usage: Double click to open{color:end}
{color:#ff1919}Attention: The box will be deleted if it is not opened within 7 days of receipt.{color:end}

A box given upon opening a Dredgion Daily Supplies Box. Open to randomly receive 1 - 6 SOL Fibers, Fiber Purifiers, or 1 Style Token of quality from Standard to Premium.

{color:#edec72}Usage: Double click or right-click to open{color:end}
{color:#ff1919}Attention: The box will be deleted if it is not opened within 7 days of receipt.{color:end}

A box given daily upon purchasing a Founder's Pack. Open to receive 1 Dredgion Weapon Augmentation Box, 1 Dredgion Style Box, and 2,000 GOLD.

{color:#edec72}Usage: Double click to open{color:end}
{color:#ff1919}Attention: A Dredgion Daily Supplies Box is issued at 6 AM every day, and the box will be deleted if it is not opened within 7 days of receipt.{color:end}
